==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|hodie|hodiē|today|lang=la}}; from {{term|hoc||this|lang=la}} + {{term|dies|dīēs|day|lang=la}}; ultimately from {{proto|Indo-European|dyeu-|to shine|lang=la}}, suffixed with [[-aŭ]].

